{"ID":"20240206095849-i6ljf9f","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206095849-i6ljf9f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095849-i6ljf9f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095857-reubhxq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095852-07a0d1q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095857-reubhxq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:107,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:107\u0026#125;","title":"核桃仁（胡桃仁）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902091853"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206095857-reubhxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095857-reubhxq","updated":"20240206095903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于新疆省、河北省、山西省等地。\n【性状】\t多破碎，为不规则的块状，有皱曲的沟槽，大小不一；完整者类球形。种皮淡黄色或黄褐色，膜状，维管柬脉纹深棕色，子叶类白色。质脆富油性。气微，味甘；种皮味涩、微苦。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t补肾，温肺，润肠。用于肾阳不足，腰膝酸软，阳痿遗精，虚寒喘嗽，肠燥便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095852-07a0d1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095852-07a0d1q","updated":"20240206095852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095852-2t99k1y.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715111811-do241g0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715111811-do241g0","updated":"20240715111811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 649px;","style":"width: 639px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁-20240715111811-1olziol.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 639px;\" parent-style=\"width: 649px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240723135710-dm10w87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240723135710-dm10w87","updated":"20240723135710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221193001-9mzr7zc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902091350-8h1q18d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091350-8h1q18d","updated":"20240902091350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 588px;","style":"width: 578px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 9-20240715124019-ce5jvy5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 578px;\" parent-style=\"width: 588px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 616px;","style":"width: 606px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 10-20240715124042-2xlta67.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 606px;\" parent-style=\"width: 616px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902091350-hiave7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091350-hiave7x","updated":"20240902091350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 646px;","style":"width: 636px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 11-20240715124150-3xi2n5f.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 636px;\" parent-style=\"width: 646px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 575px;","style":"width: 565px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 12-20240715124232-28aylvl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 565px;\" parent-style=\"width: 575px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715112001-myujq0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715112001-myujq0g","updated":"20240715112001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 778px;","style":"width: 768px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 3-20240715111934-23w9uvy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 768px;\" parent-style=\"width: 778px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 442px;","style":"width: 432px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 4-20240715111952-vyuqpn5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 432px;\" parent-style=\"width: 442px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715111842-8b49frz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715111842-8b49frz","updated":"20240715111858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 779px;","style":"width: 769px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 1-20240715111842-8iwu4w3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 769px;\" parent-style=\"width: 779px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 444px;","style":"width: 434px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 2-20240715111858-6bul0mp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 434px;\" parent-style=\"width: 444px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715123309-72uwotb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715123309-72uwotb","updated":"20240715123309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 732px;","style":"width: 722px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 8-20240715123309-pq8c99e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 722px;\" parent-style=\"width: 732px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 492px;","style":"width: 482px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 7-20240715123028-w15biit.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 482px;\" parent-style=\"width: 492px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715112044-ldk1m04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715112044-ldk1m04","updated":"20240715123122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 617px;","style":"width: 607px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 6-20240715112153-j7ed2kf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 607px;\" parent-style=\"width: 617px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 616px;","style":"width: 606px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"核桃仁 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/核桃仁 5-20240715112044-xyguf98.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 606px;\" parent-style=\"width: 616px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715112159-hr0iies","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240715112159-hr0iies"}},{"ID":"20240902091850-4ghg6lv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-4ghg6lv","updated":"20240902091853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：山核桃仁"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-999sbl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-999sbl2","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"山核桃仁"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-i0e1did","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-i0e1did","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShānHéTɑoRén"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-angxshn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-angxshn","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-88v5g1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-88v5g1k","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为胡桃科植物山核桃的种仁。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-ysqxoec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-ysqxoec","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：CaryacathayensisSarg.[Hicoriacathayensis(Sarg.)Chum]"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-ih329lg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-ih329lg","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季果实成熟时采收，干燥。在临用时再敲击果皮，剥取种仁。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-tiy8x1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-tiy8x1k","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】落叶乔木，高10-20m。树皮平滑，灰白色；髓部实心；冬芽裸露，不具芽鳞。奇数羽状复叶，互生，长16-30cm，小叶5-7枚，顶生小叶和上端的侧生小叶同形同大或稍大；叶片披针形或倒卵状披针形，稍成镰状弯曲，长10-18m，宽2-5cm，先端渐尖，基部楔形，略偏斜，边缘有细锯齿，上面绿色，下面有橙黄色腺鳞。花单性，雌雄同株；雄葇荑花序3条成1束，腋生，长10-15cm，花具短柄，无花被，有1枚苞片和2枚小苞片，雄蕊2-7；雌花序穗状，顶生，直立，花序轴密生腺体，有花1-3朵，无花被，苞片1枚，位于前方，小苞片3枚，位于两侧及后方，与苞片愈合形成一个4浅裂的壶状总苞，贴生于子房，子房下位，无花柱，柱头盘状。果实倒卵形，核果状，具4条狭翅状纵棱，成熟时4瓣开裂，内果皮坚硬骨质，淡灰黄色，厚1mm，先端急尖；隔膜内及壁内无空隙，子叶2深裂。花期4-5月，果期9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-8suci5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-8suci5a","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-poypxup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-poypxup","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于海拔400-1200m的山麓林中或腐殖质丰富的山谷中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-guc63vk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-guc63vk","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于安徽南部、浙江等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-14uectv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-14uectv","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】种仁含脂肪油及挥发油，外果皮含鞣质。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-2ezdtxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-2ezdtxe","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-djwo9uf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-djwo9uf","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-7emctvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-7emctvp","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】补益肝肾；纳气平喘。主腰膝酸软、隐痛；虚喘久咳"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-j6zzm1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-j6zzm1k","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，9-15g；或研末，3-5g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091850-lix9ljx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091850-lix9ljx","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902091849-207tur2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902091849-207tur2","updated":"20240902091855"}},{"ID":"20240902091832-9khmed2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-9khmed2","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：野核桃仁"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-888ue6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-888ue6t","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野核桃仁《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-jg5u46y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-jg5u46y","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《浙江天目山药植志》"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-cs5ltty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-cs5ltty","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】YěHéTɑoRén"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-nptkez0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-nptkez0","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为胡桃科植物野核桃的种仁。10月果实成熟时采收，堆积6～7天，待果皮霉烂后，擦去果皮，洗净，晒至半干，再击碎果核，拣取种仁，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-00gso0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-00gso0k","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-8mzmld6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-8mzmld6","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野核桃，又名：山核桃、野胡桃。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-x2fridm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-x2fridm","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"落叶乔木，高15～25米。小枝具褐色皮孔，并有腺毛及星状毛，髓部疏松成薄片状。单数羽状复叶互生，长40～50厘米；叶轴及叶柄具腺毛和星状毛；小叶9～17，无柄，卵形或卵状长圆形，长8～15厘米，宽3～7.5厘米，先端短尖，基部圆或近心形，边缘有细锯齿，上面疏被星状毛，下面密被星状毛。花单性，雌雄同株；雄花密集为细长而下垂的葇荑花序，长20～30厘米，花被4，雄蕊10～14，无花丝，花药2室：雌花6～10，成穗状花序，长20～25厘米，花被4，花柱短，柱头2裂呈绒毛状。核果卵圆形，长3～4厘米，顶端尖，外果皮肉质，密被腺毛：核卵形，有6～8棱。花期4月。果期10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-s8zrnm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-s8zrnm7","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于山坡或溪谷两旁。分布江苏、浙江、安徽、江西、湖南、湖北、四川、云南、贵州、甘肃等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-6tlr5v7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-6tlr5v7","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】种仁含油40～50％，蛋白质15～20％，糖类，维生素A、B、C等。树皮及外果皮含大量鞣质。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-ggjsfi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-ggjsfi5","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】性温平，味甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-169o59t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-169o59t","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】种仁：功能补养气血，润燥化痰，益命门，利三焦，温肺润肠。治虚寒咳嗽，下肢酸痛。油：为缓下剂，能驱除绦虫：外用治皮肤疥癣，冻疮，腋臭。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-ilugf99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-ilugf99","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】治腰痛：野核桃仁（炒熟）五至六两。捣烂冲酒服。（性味以下出《浙江天目山药植志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-v7uiyw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-v7uiyw4","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-c3e12tz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-c3e12tz","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野核桃仁《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-6tybftv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-6tybftv","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《浙江天目山药植志》"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-in2knnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-in2knnd","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】YěHéTɑoRén"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-rnkix5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-rnkix5i","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-3h3717i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-3h3717i","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为胡桃科植物野核挑的种仁。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-iak7oqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-iak7oqp","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：JuglanscathaycnsisDode[J.draconisDode]"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-fizgoaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-fizgoaw","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：10月果实成熟时采收，堆积6-7d，待果皮霉烂后，擦去果皮，洗净，晒至半干，再击碎果核，拣取种仁，晒干."}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-j3vmjkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-j3vmjkg","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】落叶乔木，高12-25m。树皮灰褐色，线纵裂。小枝被腺毛及星状毛；顶芽裸露，密生黄褐色毛；髓部疏松，薄片状。奇数羽状复叶，互生，长40-50cm，小叶9-17枚，卵形或卵状长椭圆形，硬纸质，长8-15cm，宽3-7.5cm，先端渐尖，基部斜圆形或近心形，边缘具细锯齿，两面有星状毛和腺毛。花单生，雌雄同株；雄葇荑花序下垂，长9-25cm，生于枝端叶痕腋内，雄花有花被4，雄蕊10-14，无花丝，花药2室，药隔稍伸出；雌花序穗状，直立，长5-13cm，生于新枝顶端，有雌花5-10朵，花被4裂，贴生于子房子，子房下位，花柱短，柱头2裂呈绒毛状，暗红色。核果卵形，长3-6cm,顶端尖，外果皮肉质，密被腺毛；内果皮坚硬，骨质，有6-8条纵棱，棱脊之间有不规则的皱折。种子较小，常为向内延伸的骨质果皮所隔裂。花期4-5月，果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-2erxisn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-2erxisn","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-7u7pmvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-7u7pmvf","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于海拔300-1200m的向阳山坡杂木林内或溪谷两旁土壤肥沃湿润处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-t25tt7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-t25tt7t","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于华东、西南、及山西、陕西、甘肃、湖北、湖南、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-7anlxns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-7anlxns","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】种仁含油40-50%，蛋白质15-20%，糖类，维生素A、B、C等。树皮及外果皮含大量鞣质。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-p26sna9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-p26sna9","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】抗尿石形成作用采用草酰胺尿石模型证实，核桃仁具有减缓大鼠草酰胺结石增大作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-s3lvtb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-s3lvtb4","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-dvw4z57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-dvw4z57","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；肾；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-77p216f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-77p216f","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】润肺化痰；温肾助阳；润肤；通便。主燥咳无痰；虚喘；腰膝酸软；肠燥便秘；皮肤干裂"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-gbo8zpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-gbo8zpt","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤；30-50g，或捣碎嚼10-30g。或捣烂冲酒。外用：适量，捣烂，涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-ub0zr83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-ub0zr83","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】治腰痛：野核桃仁(炒熟)五至六两。捣烂冲酒服。(性味以下出《浙江天目山药植志》)"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-xytc6ru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-xytc6ru","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】种仁：功能补养气血，润燥化疚，益命门，利三焦，温肺润肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240902091832-5bvuf59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091832-5bvuf59","updated":"20240902091855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902091834-828tke6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902091834-828tke6","updated":"20240902091855"}},{"ID":"20240902091835-m70otvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902091835-m70otvu","updated":"20240902091855"}}]}